    "text": "By KTXS Staff ,\n13 hours ago ABILENE, Texas — The parade route has returned to Cypress Street. Now, parades will go north on Pine Street, turn left on North 5th, and travel south on Cypress to end where it began on North 1st. KTXS will stream the parade live beginning at 6:30 on the KTXS... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
